---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Chinese Traditional Wear Blog | ChinaStyle"
  description="Travel stories, cultural guides, and tips for experiencing Chinese traditional clothing. Hanfu, qipao, tang suit, and ethnic textile features."
  ogImage="/images/og-dynasties.webp"
  canonicalUrl="/blog"
  articleDate="2026-08-03"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Blog", url: "/blog/" }]}>
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">ChinaStyle Blog</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif-sc text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-stone-900 mt-3">
        Chinese Traditional Wear Stories & Guides
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-stone-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        In-depth travel stories, cultural deep-dives, and practical guides for experiencing Chinese traditional clothing firsthand. From Hanfu photoshoot location reviews to qipao tailoring diaries.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-8">
        <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-widest uppercase">Experience Guide</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mt-1">5 Best Hanfu Photoshoot Spots in Xi’an (With Prices & Tips)</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">From the ancient city wall at golden hour to the atmospheric lanes of the Muslim Quarter — a complete location guide with real pricing from 2026.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-widest uppercase">Personal Story</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mt-1">Getting a Custom Qipao in Shanghai: My 4-Day Fitting Diary</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">From fabric selection at South Bund Market to the final fitting — what the custom qipao process actually looks like, with costs and timeline.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-widest uppercase">Cultural Deep-Dive</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mt-1">Miao Embroidery Villages in Guizhou: A Textile Traveler’s Guide</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Venture into Guizhou’s mountain villages where Miao women still practice embroidery techniques passed down for over a thousand years.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-widest uppercase">Comparison</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mt-1">Hanfu vs Kimono vs Hanbok: One Traveler Tries All Three</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">What happens when you wear all three East Asian traditional costumes in their home cities? A cross-cultural dressing-room diary from Xi’an, Kyoto, and Seoul.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-widest uppercase">Seasonal Guide</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mt-1">What to Wear to a Chinese Festival: A Seasonal Traditional Clothing Calendar</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Spring Festival, Mid-Autumn, Dragon Boat — which traditional outfit suits each celebration, and where to source it before you go.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-200 transition-colors">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-widest uppercase">Buying Guide</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mt-1">How to Buy Authentic Silk in China Without Getting Scammed</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Burn tests, touch tests, and the markets where real silk is still sold at honest prices — a practical guide for textile shoppers.</p>
          <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
